  "body": "> A module map is a map of absolute URLs to values that are either a module script, null, or a placeholder value \"fetching\".\n\nI think they can no longer contain null. Instead failures are now stored as a module script with the instantiation state \"failed\". I should check to make sure that's true and if so just delete that sentence.\n\nNoticed by @dominiccooney \n",
